  "ruleText": "Bar 101.52 “Student apprentice” means an individual registered in accordance with RSA 313-A:24 and being instructed in a school licensed in accordance with RSA 313-A:9, IV.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Bar 100) #6046-a, eff 6-1-95, EXPIRED: 6-1-03\n\nNew. #7932, eff 8-3-03; ss by #10412-A, eff 9-19-13 (from Bar 101.36) renumbered by #13810 (formerly Bar 101.37) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Bar 100); renumbered by #14459, eff 1-1-26 (formerly Bar 101.35)",
